      "data": {
        "text": "**Begin Implementation**\n\nI'm starting by creating `register_user.py` as requested. My initial focus is to get the user registration working with AWS. I'll then move onto the other files in the set, ensuring I leverage external providers appropriately for each to meet the user's requirements.\n\n\n**Initiate Project Structure**\n\nI've established the initial structure. `register_user.py` will use AWS Cognito for user registration and related AWS resources will be employed. I'm building supporting files: `identity_client.py` and `identity_models.py` to streamline the process. The plan is to ensure each \"scored\" file integrates with a unique third-party service. `boto3` will be used to interact with AWS Cognito.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789845354782,
          "start": 1789845353438
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bb18b3de001MSd4lJcqlEZjtX",
