      "data": {
        "text": "**Constructing Core Components**\n\nI'm now focused on building the crucial helper files: `identity_client.py` and `identity_models.py`. The latter will house request and response models for user registration and related functions, while the former is designed to manage client configurations and shared resources. These are essential for the identity-related operations.\n\n\n**Defining Data Structures**\n\nMy current thinking centers on solidifying the data structures within `identity_models.py`, which is going to be pivotal for defining data exchange formats related to user registration, and other key identity processes. I'm prioritizing the structure of requests and responses. The `identity_client.py` file is currently taking a backseat, and I'll revisit it to consolidate any necessary helper functionality.\n\n\n",
