        "text": "**Implementing Cognito Flows**\n\nOkay, I'm now focusing on implementing the remaining scored files that involve Cognito. Specifically, `email_password_login.py`, `refresh_session.py`, and `password_reset.py`.  My plan is to build out the `email_password` flow first.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Cognito Files**\n\nI'm moving forward with the Cognito-related files now. I've decided to prioritize the implementation of `email_password_login.py` first, then I'll tackle the `refresh_session.py` and `password_reset.py` files. I believe this will create a better workflow.\n\n\n",
